Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 23:45:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] lattice: bank-level lattice-bridge capitalization tests

End-to-end tests on a real Bank with the bridge feature and accounts in
genesis: governance binds the Lattice genesis hash, a guardian-attested
deposit mints exactly once and raises capitalization by the minted
amount, a replay is rejected without moving supply, a burn lowers
capitalization by exactly the burned amount and writes a receipt, a
mint inside a failing transaction changes nothing, and after freeze
capitalization equals the recomputed account sum.

Not compiled on the development host (disk); run on the build server:
cargo test -p solana-runtime --lib lattice_bridge

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
